title: IncomprehensibleGreeting
---
Sheolite Warden: Hail, stone breaker. It is my purpose to treat with those such as you.
<<if get_biotic_level() < 2 >>
    <<jump End02>>
<<endif>>
Sheolite Warden: I represent the stone-folders, or Sheolites as you would say. 
Sheolite Warden: I am warden of this sector of stone. To what end do you now enter our domain?
-> I'm exploring the area where my sister was last seen. I humbly ask your permission to examine the area.
    <<jump PolitelyAsksToExplore>>
-> What is it to you? I can go where I please.
    <<jump ImpolitelyAddressesSheoliteWarden>>
===

title: PolitelyAsksToExplore
---
Sheolite Warden: I see no reason to prevent it. The danger is to you, I fear. We stone-folders do not fear such as you.
-> What kind of dangers?
Sheolite Warden: We share this domain with beasts, as you might describe them. They do not threaten us.
Sheolite Warden: They are low-beings but we share a sort of common simplistic pidgin. 
Sheolite Warden: It must be learned but I haven't the time to teach you now. Some day perhaps.
-> I understand, warden. I do not hold you responsible for my safety.
Sheolite Warden: Very well. I grant you limited passage through our domain. Perhaps I shall see you soon.
<<jump EndPlaytest >>
===

title: ImpolitelyAddressesSheoliteWarden
---
Sheolite Warden: You cannot. I control entry in this domain. I must know your purpose.
-> I seek my sister who was last seen in this area.
Sheolite Warden: I see. Do you ask for forgiveness?
-> I am sorry for my rudeness. I humbly ask your permission to examine the area.
    <<jump PolitelyAsksToExplore>>
-> Go to hell, fucking squid thing...
    <<jump End02>>
===


title: EndPlaytest
---
-> END THE PLAYTEST
    <<end_playtest DialogueCommands>>
    -> End Dialogue
===